{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/LogoHeader.png?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this demo, step into the war-torn world of Hive Blight and stand against the rising tide of corruption.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead the fearless Vespada and the joyful Sweet Symphoney into battle. Master the synergies between 20 unique units, and wield over 20 powerful equipments and trinkets to turn the tide in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push through 2 full chapters of danger and discovery, and test your limits against 5 escalating Blight Levels.<br>Will you survive the Blight\u2014or be consumed by it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/ChooseParty.png?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/ChooseParty_3.gif?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your strategic senses to pick the best insectoid recruits to face the fungal monstrosities! Each has their own strengths and weaknesses, and it\u2019s up to you to make good use of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/FightInvasion.png?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/FightTheInvasion_1.gif?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the threat head-on! Find the best placement and strategy to defeat your opponents and break through the enemy lines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/GetRewards.png?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/GetRewards_1.gif?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect nectar after each confrontation\u2014it will heal your fighters and support your economy. It is the most precious resource. The vanquished often leave wares behind, so pick them up; you'll make better use of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also spend your nectar in the shop, but beware not to spend it all at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/FindSynergies.png?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/FindSyngergies_1.gif?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with your team composition, figure out how your units interact, equip weapons, make use of your relics, and create efficient synergies to face the onslaught!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643400?t=1746601360","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643400?t=1746601360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/30a13686e483b6d81d0e5640da1ae3180d03d3dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746601360","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/30a13686e483b6d81d0e5640da1ae3180d03d3dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746601360","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/LogoHeader.png?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this demo, step into the war-torn world of Hive Blight and stand against the rising tide of corruption.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead the fearless Vespada and the joyful Sweet Symphoney into battle. Master the synergies between 20 unique units, and wield over 20 powerful equipments and trinkets to turn the tide in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push through 2 full chapters of danger and discovery, and test your limits against 5 escalating Blight Levels.<br>Will you survive the Blight\u2014or be consumed by it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/ChooseParty.png?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/ChooseParty_3.gif?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your strategic senses to pick the best insectoid recruits to face the fungal monstrosities! Each has their own strengths and weaknesses, and it\u2019s up to you to make good use of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/FightInvasion.png?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/FightTheInvasion_1.gif?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the threat head-on! Find the best placement and strategy to defeat your opponents and break through the enemy lines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/GetRewards.png?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/GetRewards_1.gif?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect nectar after each confrontation\u2014it will heal your fighters and support your economy. It is the most precious resource. The vanquished often leave wares behind, so pick them up; you'll make better use of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also spend your nectar in the shop, but beware not to spend it all at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/FindSynergies.png?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/extras/FindSyngergies_1.gif?t=1746601360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with your team composition, figure out how your units interact, equip weapons, make use of your relics, and create efficient synergies to face the onslaught!</p>","developers":["OptizOnion"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2886620","name":"Hive Blight"},"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643400/7c2b5811cb5f38b16d1d1261a0871fc747b15027/header.jpg?t=1746601360","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136225,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136225/movie480.mp4?t=1746601359","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136225/movie_max.mp4?t=1746601359"},"name":"Hive Blight Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s